    <bpmn:process id="W_W4324" name="W4324. Housekeeping, Sanitation, Linen &amp; Common-Area Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily operation; SLA cycle
Frequency: Daily/weekly per site
Volume: Per-site housekeeping across housed units/common areas
Owner: Housing Ops / Facilities (VS-138) / Housekeeping Vendor
Participants: Facilities (VS-138), Housekeeping Vendor/Staff, Housing Ops, HSE (VS-24), Contingent (VS-98)
Source: workflow W4324 — Housekeeping, Sanitation, Linen &amp; Common-Area Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4324_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4324_Lane1" name="Housing Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4324_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4324_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4324_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4324_Lane2" name="Housekeeping">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4324_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4324_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4324_Start4" name="Daily operation; SLA cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4324_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4324_Task5" name="Housing Ops/Facilities set the housekeeping standard &amp; schedule — common-area…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Housing Ops/Facilities set the housekeeping standard &amp; schedule — common-area cleaning frequency, sanitation, linen/laundry, waste removal, pest control (VS-138) — per HSE hygiene
Responsible (R): Housing Ops / Facilities / HSE
Accountable (A): Housing Ops Lead
Duration: Standard</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4324_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4324_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4324_Task6" name="Housekeeping staff/vendor execute the schedule, log completion, and report…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Housekeeping staff/vendor execute the schedule, log completion, and report deficiencies/maintenance needs (W4329)
Responsible (R): Housekeeping / Vendor
Accountable (A): Housing Ops Lead
Duration: Daily/weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4324_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4324_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4324_Task7" name="Housing Ops/HSE inspect hygiene/sanitation vs standard, enforce vendor SLA…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Housing Ops/HSE inspect hygiene/sanitation vs standard, enforce vendor SLA (W4330), and remediate deficiencies
Responsible (R): Housing Ops / HSE
Accountable (A): Housing Ops Lead / HSE Mgr
