      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Medical/health event; fire/emergency; drill cycle
Frequency: Per event + periodic drills
Volume: Per-site health/emergency response for residents
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Housing Ops / Occupational Health (VS-83)
Participants: HSE (VS-24), Occupational Health (VS-83), BFP, Housing Ops, Insurance (VS-26), BCP (VS-26), HR (VS-103)
Source: workflow W4327 — Health, Emergency &amp; Evacuation in Dormitories</bpmn:documentation>
