Responsible (R): Occupational Health / HSE
Accountable (A): HSE Mgr
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4327_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4327_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4327_Task7" name="HSE/Insurance/BCP manage emergencies (fire, medical, natural disaster VS-69)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HSE/Insurance/BCP manage emergencies (fire, medical, natural disaster VS-69), evacuate/restore, file insurance (VS-26), and feed BCP/risk (VS-26/VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): HSE / Insurance / BCP
Accountable (A): HSE Mgr / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4327_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
