    <bpmn:process id="W_W4328" name="W4328. Resident Experience, Engagement &amp; Retention Linkage" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Engagement cycle; turnover review
Frequency: Quarterly + on turnover
Volume: Housed-employee population engagement
Owner: HR/EX (VS-103) / Housing Ops / People Analytics (VS-103.3)
Participants: HR/EX (VS-103), People Analytics (VS-103.3), Housing Ops, Store/DC Ops (VS-07/VS-04), Strategy (VS-33)
Source: workflow W4328 — Resident Experience, Engagement &amp; Retention Linkage</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4328_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4328_Lane1" name="HR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4328_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4328_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4328_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4328_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4328_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4328_Start3" name="Engagement cycle; turnover review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4328_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4328_Task4" name="HR/EX measure housed-employee experience (housing-satisfaction pulse…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HR/EX measure housed-employee experience (housing-satisfaction pulse, commute+housing as retention drivers vs VS-141), and segment by site/role
Responsible (R): HR/EX / People Analytics
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4328_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4328_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4328_Task5" name="HR/Ops analyze housing impact on retention/turnover (do housed employees stay…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: HR/Ops analyze housing impact on retention/turnover (do housed employees stay longer?), and quantify the retention value vs housing cost
Responsible (R): HR / People Analytics / Finance
Accountable (A): CHRO / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4328_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4328_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4328_Task6" name="HR/Housing Ops act on findings (improve housing, expand coverage where…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HR/Housing Ops act on findings (improve housing, expand coverage where retention-ROI positive) and feed strategy (W4313)
Responsible (R): HR / Housing Ops / Strategy
Accountable (A): CHRO / COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4328_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4328_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4328_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4328_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-663 (ensure controlled execution — Dormitory/Accommodation Operations, Occupancy &amp; Resident Welfare (PA-144.2).) | - CTL-663: housing impact measured; retention-ROI quantified; improvement actions tracked
Owner: HR/EX (VS-103) / Housing Ops / People Analytics (VS-103.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
